      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Left margin",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>Recipe for making a silvery paste</li>\n<li>]Take two dirhams of jade stone (called [____]), two dirhams of bitter almond, two dirhams of orpiment, and two dirhams of gold-colored leaf.</li>\n<li>Combine all, then add half a measure (mithq\u0101l) of mercury, forming it into a ball. Coat it with yellow clay mixed with the hair of a human, and cover the flask</li>\n<li>before firing......[</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
